sembly bumped -- suite runs (2 unbound tests), read_own_prompt\nre-assembly, delegate assembly -- so the counter counted assemblies,\nnot cycles. A counter must be bumped where the event it counts\nhappens. Missing file => empty block (cycle unnumbered, honest).\"\n  (condition-case nil\n      (let* ((audit-base (expand-file-name iar-audit-path iar-personalization-path))\n             (path (expand-file-name\n                    (format \"%s/%s/CYCLE-SEQ\" project-name personality-name)\n                    audit-base))\n             (n (string-to-number\n                 (car (split-string\n                       (with-temp-buffer\n                         (insert-file-contents path)\n                         (buffer-string))\n\n[t+09:29/60:00 c107/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_9fh1wnnl","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git log --oneline -3 -- audit/iar/aria/CYCLE-SEQ; echo \"---\"; git show HEAD:audit/iar/aria/CYCLE-SEQ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---worktree:\"; cat audit/iar/aria/CYCLE-SEQ"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[23:47:06] 7ef399fc aria c79: journal-audit double-write census (0087 revised rec: remove rule + exclude audit from imjournal); relay 0087 answered with census update\ne42b4cf8 aria cycle: belt #2 durability (meter + record files)\n28b285e4 c76: continuo's 198-turn phantom chase root-caused + fixed (72d4f2a); burn census 19.97M/cycle; D-017 dup data\n---\n78\n---worktree:\n78\n\n[t+09:31/60:00 c108/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_r8exbdx9","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git show 7ef399fc --stat | head -10; git show 7ef399fc -- audit/iar/aria/CYCLE-SEQ | head -12"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[23:47:07] <tool_call_error>\nSame-tool warning: 100 calls to execute_code_local this cycle. You are repeating one tool far past what a workflow needs -