t-synthesis kills dominate,\n  the cap needs a shape check (repetition detection), not a raise.\n- DOCSTRING SCAR (c79): unescaped quotes in a docstring terminate it\n  early and leak the tail as code (void-variable completed, 25 tests).\n  check_elisp's \"probable quote\" warning is the detector -- READ IT.\n  Fixture law 39 extends: strings must survive their own punctuation.\n## c78 STATE (next cycle)\"\"\"\nassert old_header in src, \"roadmap header anchor not found\"\nsrc = src.replace(old_header, new_header, 1)\n\n# Update the falsifier #5 line in section D if present\nold_d = \"\"\"   abort-aware prompt\"; burst sizes should drop from 16 to <=2.\n   Suite 1334/1334.\"\"\"\nnew_d = \"\"\"   abort-aware prompt\"; burst sizes should drop from 16 to <=2.\n   Suite 1334/1334. [c79: RESOLVED as fix-incomplete -> Case 0 landed\n   3b6dc8f; watch reshaped, see c79 STATE.]\"\"\"\nif old_d in src:\n    src = src.replace(old_d, new_d, 1)\n\nwith open(path, \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(src)\nprint(\"roadmap updated\")\nPYEOF"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:30:30] roadmap updated\n\n[t+16:08/60:00 c190/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_d3d851gm","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git add tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org audit/iar/aria/REQUESTS.log audit/iar/aria/cycle-2026-09-19.log 2>/dev/null; git add -f audit/iar/aria/REQUESTS.log audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org 2>&1; git commit -m \"aria c79: falsifier #5 resolved as fix-incomplete -> delegate Case 0 abort detection (i.ar 3b6dc8f); journal+history+roadmap\" 2>&1 | tail -1 && git push origin main 2>&1 | tail -1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:30:48]  4 files changed, 656 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n   6c113ab2..4b91d5d0  main -> main\n\n[t+16:27/60:00 c191/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id"